; A constant compared with a value it cannot be is rc 4 (2026-10-19,
; Planner.settle_constant#): the literal takes the operand's type and must
; fit it. Before, `u8_of(44) = 300` kept the literal's `int`, widened the u8
; and was always false at rc 0.
; xfail: the constant 300 does not fit u8
function u8_of(n: int) returns u8
    n as u8

if u8_of(44) = 300
    print "equal"
